<view class="area data-v-dc700c88"><view wx:if="{{a}}" class="order-note data-v-dc700c88"><text class="data-v-dc700c88">当前待付款订单已生成，新增商品需要重新合并下单才能享受满减。</text><text class="data-v-dc700c88">下面按当前购物车重新计算。原订单中的商品和金额单独保留，请处理原订单后再提交新订单。</text><button class="data-v-dc700c88" size="mini" bindtap="{{b}}">查看原订单</button></view><view wx:if="{{c}}" class="notice data-v-dc700c88">正在核对商品、满减规则和可售库存…</view><view wx:elif="{{d}}" class="notice data-v-dc700c88"><text class="data-v-dc700c88">{{e}}</text><button class="data-v-dc700c88" bindtap="{{f}}">重新加载</button></view><block wx:elif="{{g}}"><view class="summary data-v-dc700c88"><text class="title data-v-dc700c88">{{h}}</text><text class="data-v-dc700c88">同款同专区满{{i}}元减{{j}}元</text><text class="data-v-dc700c88">当前购物车已选 ¥{{k}}，还差 ¥{{l}}</text><text class="data-v-dc700c88">本页仅列出库存足够凑足门槛的同款规格，凑单后按最新规则统一结算。</text></view><view wx:if="{{m}}" class="notice data-v-dc700c88"><text class="data-v-dc700c88">当前购物车商品已达到该满减门槛。</text><button class="data-v-dc700c88" disabled="{{n}}" bindtap="{{o}}">返回确认订单</button></view><view wx:elif="{{p}}" class="notice data-v-dc700c88">当前没有库存足够凑足门槛的规格，请返回调整商品或稍后再试。</view><view wx:for="{{q}}" wx:for-item="candidate" wx:key="h" class="candidate data-v-dc700c88"><image class="data-v-dc700c88" src="{{candidate.a}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="candidate-info data-v-dc700c88"><text class="data-v-dc700c88">{{candidate.b}}</text><text class="data-v-dc700c88">单价 ¥{{candidate.c}}</text><text class="data-v-dc700c88">再加 {{candidate.d}} 件，共 ¥{{candidate.e}}，可达到满减门槛</text><button class="data-v-dc700c88" size="mini" disabled="{{r}}" bindtap="{{candidate.g}}">{{candidate.f}}</button></view></view></block></view>